    "summary": "Errata to **[Doctrina Imperatives](vsdata:ability/adeptus-mechanicus.doctrina-imperatives)**. Protector Imperative gives ranged weapons **[[HEAVY]](vsdata:weapon-ability/heavy)** and +1 Ballistic Skill. Apply a −1 melee hit modifier against a defender that is BATTLELINE or within 6 inches of your ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE units. Conqueror Imperative gives ranged weapons **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)** and melee weapons +1 Weapon Skill. The same proximity or keyword condition gives that unit’s attacks +1 Armour Penetration.",
